1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Hello everyone!
This is my Task 4 submission for the Data Analytics Internship at ApexPlanet Software Pvt. Ltd.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
In this task, I performed exploratory data analysis on the Sample Superstore Dataset using Python.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
I explored the dataset, checked data types, verified missing values,
and generated statistical summaries.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
I also created new date features such as Year, Month, Day,
and Weekday for better time-based analysis.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Then, I created insightful visualizations including
Sales by Category, Profit by Category, and Sales by Region.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
I also analyzed Monthly Sales Trends
and identified the Top 10 Products by Sales.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
From this analysis, I found that the Technology category
generated the highest sales and profit.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
The West region recorded the highest sales,
while sales increased significantly during the final months of the year.

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
This project enhanced my skills in Python,
Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, and Data Visualization.

10
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Thank you to ApexPlanet Software Pvt. Ltd.
for this valuable learning opportunity.